# Vercel serves the repo root as static files, so anything committed here is
# reachable at a URL. These are development-only and have no business being
# served: test suites, and the SQL migration history.
#
# lib/ is deliberately NOT listed — api/ingest.ts imports it, so excluding it
# would break the ingestion function's build. It contains no secrets (the
# service-role key is read from the environment), and the repo is public
# anyway, so serving that one file costs nothing.
scripts/
supabase/
